#   DShield is an intrusion detection system for data collection and analysis.
#   The project collects data about malicious activity from across the Internet.
#   This data is cataloged and summarized and can be used to discover trends
#   in activity, confirm widespread attacks, or assist in preparing better
#   firewall rules.
#   
#   This third-party blocklist is not maintained by ConfigServer; IPs are
#   sourced externally and not curated by us. We do however, validate the
#   blocklist to ensure that it only contains properly validated IP addresses,
#   and does not include any non-relevant or malformed data beyond the scope
#   of the source.
